  "id": "malariaatlas/tcw",
  "title": "Tasselled Cap Wetness",
  "description": "Global raster dataset of Tasselled Cap Wetness (TCW) derived from MODIS MCD43D62\u2013MCD43D68 v6.1 surface reflectance products at 1 km and 5 km spatial resolution. TCW values are computed using the Lobser & Cohen (2007) spectral transformation with gap-filling to remove cloud and missing-data artefacts. Temporal coverage includes 8-daily, monthly, annual, and synoptic summaries with statistical aggregations (min, max, mean, SD, range, and count).",
